    {
      "id": "nouns",
      "topic": "grammar",
      "title": "Gender and number",
      "body": "Feminine nouns are wrapped in ⵜ…ⵜ. Regular plurals change the first vowel to ⵉ and add ⵏ (masculine) or ⵉⵏ (feminine). The table shows “student” and “teacher”.",
